{"id":"precipitations","title":"Precipitations","author":"Evelyn Scott","year":"1920","note":"Manhattan as sexual weather — bridge dusk, potter’s field, crowd-heat between Sandburg and Crane.","minutes":186,"cover":"","coverAlt":"","scenes":[{"id":"s0","title":"Chapter 1","place":"Chapter 1","reentry":"MIDNIGHT WORSHIP:  BROOKLYN BRIDGE","prompt":"What does the poem hold?"}],"breaths":[{"id":"s0-0","sceneId":"s0","text":"MIDNIGHT WORSHIP:  BROOKLYN BRIDGE"},{"id":"s0-1","sceneId":"s0","text":"In the rain"},{"id":"s0-2","sceneId":"s0","text":"Rows of street lamps are saints in bright garments"},{"id":"s0-3","sceneId":"s0","text":"That flow long with the bend of knees."},{"id":"s0-4","sceneId":"s0","text":"They lift pale heads nimbussed with golden spikes."},{"id":"s0-5","sceneId":"s0","text":"Up the lanes of liquid onyx"},{"id":"s0-6","sceneId":"s0","text":"Toward the high fire-laden altars"},{"id":"s0-7","sceneId":"s0","text":"Move the saints of Manhattan"},{"id":"s0-8","sceneId":"s0","text":"In endless pilgrimage to death,"},{"id":"s0-9","sceneId":"s0","text":"Amidst the asphodel and anemones of dawn."},{"id":"s0-10","sceneId":"s0","text":"ASCENSION:  AUTUMN DUSK IN CENTRAL PARK"},{"id":"s0-11","sceneId":"s0","text":"Featureless people glide with dim motion through a quivering"},{"id":"s0-12","sceneId":"s0","text":"blue silver;"},{"id":"s0-13","sceneId":"s0","text":"Boats merge with the bronze-gold welters about their keels."},{"id":"s0-14","sceneId":"s0","text":"The trees float upward in gray and green flames."},{"id":"s0-15","sceneId":"s0","text":"Clouds, swans, boats, trees, all gliding up a hillside"},{"id":"s0-16","sceneId":"s0","text":"After some gray old women who lift their gaunt forms"},{"id":"s0-17","sceneId":"s0","text":"From falling shrouds of leaves."},{"id":"s0-18","sceneId":"s0","text":"Thin fingered twigs clutch darkly at nothing."},{"id":"s0-19","sceneId":"s0","text":"Crackling skeletons shine."},{"id":"s0-20","sceneId":"s0","text":"Along the smutted horizon of Fifth Avenue"},{"id":"s0-21","sceneId":"s0","text":"The hooded houses watch heavily"},{"id":"s0-22","sceneId":"s0","text":"With oily gold eyes."},{"id":"s0-23","sceneId":"s0","text":"STARTLED FORESTS: HUDSON RIVER"},{"id":"s0-24","sceneId":"s0","text":"The thin hill pushes against the mist."},{"id":"s0-25","sceneId":"s0","text":"Its fading defiance sounds in the umber and red of autumn leaves."},{"id":"s0-26","sceneId":"s0","text":"Like a dead arm around a warm throat"},{"id":"s0-27","sceneId":"s0","text":"Is the sagging embrace of the river"},{"id":"s0-28","sceneId":"s0","text":"Laid grayly about the shore."},{"id":"s0-29","sceneId":"s0","text":"The train passes."},{"id":"s0-30","sceneId":"s0","text":"We emerge from a tunnel into a sky of thin blue morning glories"},{"id":"s0-31","sceneId":"s0","text":"Where yellow lily bells tinkle down."},{"id":"s0-32","sceneId":"s0","text":"The paths run swiftly away under the lamp glow"},{"id":"s0-33","sceneId":"s0","text":"Like green and blue lizards"},{"id":"s0-34","sceneId":"s0","text":"Mottled with light."},{"id":"s0-35","sceneId":"s0","text":"WINTER STREETS"},{"id":"s0-36","sceneId":"s0","text":"The stars, escaping,"},{"id":"s0-37","sceneId":"s0","text":"Evaporate in acrid mists."},{"id":"s0-38","sceneId":"s0","text":"The houses, rearing themselves higher,"},{"id":"s0-39","sceneId":"s0","text":"Assemble among the clouds."},{"id":"s0-40","sceneId":"s0","text":"Night blows through me."},{"id":"s0-41","sceneId":"s0","text":"I am clear with its bitterness."},{"id":"s0-42","sceneId":"s0","text":"I tinkle along brick canyons"},{"id":"s0-43","sceneId":"s0","text":"Like a crystal leaf."},{"id":"s0-44","sceneId":"s0","text":"FEBRUARY SPRINGTIME"},{"id":"s0-45","sceneId":"s0","text":"The trees hold out pale gilded branches"},{"id":"s0-46","sceneId":"s0","text":"Stiff and high in the wind."},{"id":"s0-47","sceneId":"s0","text":"On the lawns"},{"id":"s0-48","sceneId":"s0","text":"Patches of gray-lilac snow"},{"id":"s0-49","sceneId":"s0","text":"Melt in the hollows of the terraces."},{"id":"s0-50","sceneId":"s0","text":"The park is an ocean of fawn-colored plush,"},{"id":"s0-51","sceneId":"s0","text":"Ridged and faded."},{"id":"s0-52","sceneId":"s0","text":"Sharp and delicate,"},{"id":"s0-53","sceneId":"s0","text":"My shadow moves after me on the rumpled grass--"},{"id":"s0-54","sceneId":"s0","text":"Grass like a pillow worn by a dear head."},{"id":"s0-55","sceneId":"s0","text":"Joy!"},{"id":"s0-56","sceneId":"s0","text":"THE ASSUMPTION OF COLUMBINE"},{"id":"s0-57","sceneId":"s0","text":"The lights trickle grayly down from the hoary palisades"},{"id":"s0-58","sceneId":"s0","text":"And drip into the river."},{"id":"s0-59","sceneId":"s0","text":"Leaden reflections flow into the water."},{"id":"s0-60","sceneId":"s0","text":"Framed in your window,"},{"id":"s0-61","sceneId":"s0","text":"Your little face glows deceptively"},{"id":"s0-62","sceneId":"s0","text":"In a rigid ecstasy,"},{"id":"s0-63","sceneId":"s0","text":"As the wide-winged morning"},{"id":"s0-64","sceneId":"s0","text":"Folds back the mist."},{"id":"s0-65","sceneId":"s0","text":"FROM BROOKLYN"},{"id":"s0-66","sceneId":"s0","text":"Along the shore"},{"id":"s0-67","sceneId":"s0","text":"A black net of branches"},{"id":"s0-68","sceneId":"s0","text":"Tangles the pulpy yellow lamps."},{"id":"s0-69","sceneId":"s0","text":"The shell-colored sky is lustrous with the fading sun."},{"id":"s0-70","sceneId":"s0","text":"Across the river Manhattan floats--"},{"id":"s0-71","sceneId":"s0","text":"Dim gardens of fire--"},{"id":"s0-72","sceneId":"s0","text":"And rushing invisible toward me through the fog,"},{"id":"s0-73","sceneId":"s0","text":"A hurricane of faces."},{"id":"s0-74","sceneId":"s0","text":"SNOW DANCE"},{"id":"s0-75","sceneId":"s0","text":"Black brooms of trees sweep the sky clean;"},{"id":"s0-76","sceneId":"s0","text":"Sweep the house fronts,"},{"id":"s0-77","sceneId":"s0","text":"And leave them bleak in sleep."},{"id":"s0-78","sceneId":"s0","text":"High up the empty moon"},{"id":"s0-79","sceneId":"s0","text":"Spills her vacuity."},{"id":"s0-80","sceneId":"s0","text":"I dance."},{"id":"s0-81","sceneId":"s0","text":"My long black shadow"},{"id":"s0-82","sceneId":"s0","text":"Weaves an invisible pattern of pain."},{"id":"s0-83","sceneId":"s0","text":"The snow"},{"id":"s0-84","sceneId":"s0","text":"Is embroidered with my happiness."},{"id":"s0-85","sceneId":"s0","text":"POTTER'S FIELD"},{"id":"s0-86","sceneId":"s0","text":"Golden petals, honey sweet,"},{"id":"s0-87","sceneId":"s0","text":"Crushed beneath fear-hastened feet..."},{"id":"s0-88","sceneId":"s0","text":"Silver paper lanterns glow and shudder"},{"id":"s0-89","sceneId":"s0","text":"in flat patterns"},{"id":"s0-90","sceneId":"s0","text":"On a gray eternal face"},{"id":"s0-91","sceneId":"s0","text":"Stained with pain."},{"id":"s0-92","sceneId":"s0","text":"LIGHTS AT NIGHT"},{"id":"s0-93","sceneId":"s0","text":"In the city,"},{"id":"s0-94","sceneId":"s0","text":"Storms of light"},{"id":"s0-95","sceneId":"s0","text":"Surge against the clouds,"}]}